Extract a portable SQLite documentation snapshot

Usage: diplodocus extract [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --config <PATH>  Path to the workspace configuration file [default: ./diplodocus.toml]
      --output <PATH>  Snapshot destination (defaults to .diplodocus/documentation.sqlite beside the configuration)
      --watch          Re-extract changed inputs and emit a JSON line after each published snapshot
  -h, --help           Print help
